{"id":"estupidez","lemma":"estupidez","pos":"noun","rank":2144,"glosses":["stupidity, the property of being stupid","a stupid act or statement"],"ipa":"/(i)ʃ.tu.piˈdeʃ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"estupidezes"},"examples":[{"text":"Fazer aquilo seria estupidez.","en":"Doing that would be stupid.","words":[{"g":"to create"},{"g":"that over there, yon","l":"aquele"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Isso parece estupidez.","en":"This seems stupid.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to seem","l":"parecer"},null]},{"text":"Não há cura para a estupidez.","en":"There's no cure for stupidity.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"cure"},{"g":"for / to"},{"g":"the / to"},null]},{"text":"Gastei todo o meu dinheiro com estupidezes.","en":"I spent all my money on stupid stuff.","words":[{"g":"to spend","l":"gastar"},{"g":"every"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"my, mine"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Seria estupidez fazer isso de novo.","en":"It would be stupid to do that again.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"to create"},{"g":"that"},null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"again"]]}]}